lass=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"091259c83b563d39\" href=\"?note=091259c83b563d39\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9SplittingLevel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9SplittingLevel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T\\times T:u\\subseteq v\\}\">\\(R=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T\\times T:u\\subseteq v\\}\\)</span>；这是由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 唯一确定的集合关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的初始序数基数函数，不是未声明的额外大小参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9SplittingLevel}_S(n,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land \\exists s\\in T\\;\\left(\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(s,n)\\land \\left|\\{t\\in T\\mid s\\subsetneq t\\land \\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,n+1)\\}\\right|\\geq 2\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9SplittingLevel}_S(n,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land \\exists s\\in T\\;\\left(\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(s,n)\\land \\left|\\{t\\in T\\mid s\\subsetneq t\\land \\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,n+1)\\}\\right|\\geq 2\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary tree definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md","status":"resolved","id":"091259c83b563d39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md","status":"resolved","id":"091259c83b563d39","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b7095959